        <naukri-version-1:Jobs_Job_Description>Key Responsibilities

Design and develop engaging German language learning content tailored to the needs of the US market.
Collaborate with the Content Head and other team members to ensure a cohesive and comprehensive curriculum.
Utilize feedback and data analytics to refine and optimize content for maximum engagement and effectiveness.
Stay updated with the latest trends in language education to innovate and continuously improve our content offering.

Qualifications

Proficiency in German and strong English communication skills.
Proven track record of creating compelling content for language learning, preferably with experience working for language learning platforms.
Demonstrated leadership ability with experience in team collaboration and mentorship.
Strong understanding of curriculum development and educational content strategy.
Creative thinker with a data-driven approach to content creation and optimization.
Bachelor&apos;s degree in German, Education, Linguistics, or a related field is preferred.</naukri-version-1:Jobs_Job_Description>
        <naukri-version-1:Jobs_Key_Skills>German, Curriculum Development, Content Writing</naukri-version-1:Jobs_Key_Skills>
